- **[Set Token Pool Rate Limits](/ccip/tutorials/evm/cross-chain-token/update-rate-limiters-hardhat)**\
  Apply transfer limits as an additional safety control.

- **[Configure Additional Networks](/ccip/tutorials/evm/cross-chain-token/configure-additional-networks-hardhat)**\
  Expand token support to more blockchains.

### Use the tooling

- **[Token Manager](/ccip/tutorials/evm/token-manager)**\
