        ✅ Pool Set Complete on Avalanche Fuji!
        ========================================
        Token Address: 0x72b2e4258A56Ee8528Fb5B303c819E9D43044dcF
        https://testnet.snowscan.xyz/address/0x72b2e4258A56Ee8528Fb5B303c819E9D43044dcF
        Pool Address: 0x7a64D0FDd6A299AdC3eA78f692ed58B4561F322d
        https://testnet.snowscan.xyz/address/0x7a64D0FDd6A299AdC3eA78f692ed58B4561F322d
        ========================================

        -----------------OTHER LOGS-----------------
     ```
</Accordion>

<Accordion title="Transfer Tokens Across Networks" number={9} startOpen={false}>
  Use the `TransferTokens.s.sol` script to transfer tokens from Ethereum Sepolia to Avalanche Fuji using CCIP. \
  You can choose to pay CCIP fees using LINK tokens or the native gas token.

  > **Note:**
  >
  > 1. Set `AMOUNT` to override the transfer amount (defaults to `tokenAmountToTransfer` in `script/input/token.json`).
  > 2. Set `FEE_TYPE=LINK` to pay fees with LINK (defaults to native token).
  > 3. Set `BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS=<n>` to use custom finality (requires pool support; defaults to `0`, which uses default finality).

  <GitHubCard title="TransferTokens.s.sol" href="https://github.com/smartcontractkit/docs-cct-foundry/blob/main/script/operations/TransferTokens.s.sol" iconName="github-svg-card">
    View the transfer script on GitHub.
  </GitHubCard>

  1. Transfer tokens from Ethereum Sepolia to Avalanche Fuji on **default finality**:

  ```bash filename="Terminal"
  DEST_CHAIN=AVALANCHE_FUJI \
    AMOUNT=1000000000000000000 \
    forge script \
    script/operations/TransferTokens.s.sol \
    --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL \
    --account $KEYSTORE_NAME \
    --broadcast
  ```

  Example output:

  ```bash filename="Terminal"
    -----------------OTHER LOGS-----------------
  [Step 1] Validating destination chain support on Ethereum Sepolia
    Destination chain is supported!

  [Step 2] Preparing CCIP message for transfer to Avalanche Fuji

  [Step 3] Approving router to spend tokens
    Approved 1000000000000000000 tokens for router

  [Step 4] Estimating transfer fees
    Estimated fees: 630000000000000

  [Step 5] Sending CCIP message
    Paid fees with native token

    ========================================
    ✅ Transfer Complete from Ethereum Sepolia!
    ========================================
    Message ID:
    0xa3ac788e347afc8eacac3a63c56e948fecbe1151a50fb2a8e76b2f5130280a2a

    Track your message at: https://ccip-ui-ccip-20-holding-branch-chainlinklabs.vercel.app/#/side-drawer/msg/0xa3ac788e347afc8eacac3a63c56e948fecbe1151a50fb2a8e76b2f5130280a2a
    ========================================

    -----------------OTHER LOGS-----------------
  ```

  2. Transfer tokens from Ethereum Sepolia to Avalanche Fuji on **custom finality**:

  ```bash filename="Terminal"
  DEST_CHAIN=AVALANCHE_FUJI \
    AMOUNT=1000000000000000000 \
    BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS=7 \
    forge script \
    script/operations/TransferTokens.s.sol \
    --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL \
    --account $KEYSTORE_NAME \
    --broadcast
  ```

  Example output:

  ```bash filename="Terminal"
  == Logs ==

    ========================================
    💸 Transfer Tokens
    ========================================
    Source Chain: Ethereum Sepolia
    Destination Chain: Avalanche Fuji
    ========================================

    Transfer Parameters:
      Token: 0x2d2d49538B0121fe912211d1dF39cB708B5f868C
      Amount: 1000000000000000000
      Fee Type: native
      Block Confirmations: 7
      Router: 0xc0f457e615348708FaAB3B40ECC26Badb32B7b30
      Destination Chain Selector: 14767482510784806043


  [Pre-validation] Checking custom finality support...
    ❌ BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS too low.
       Minimum required: 20, provided: 7

       Option 1: Increase BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS to meet the pool minimum:

         BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS=20 DEST_CHAIN=AVALANCHE_FUJI AMOUNT=1000000000000000000 forge script script/operations/TransferTokens.s.sol --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL --account $KEYSTORE_NAME --broadcast

       Option 2: Lower the pool minimum to match your value (if you own the pool):

         MIN_BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS=7 forge script script/configure/min-block-confirmations/SetMinBlockConfirmations.s.sol --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL --account $KEYSTORE_NAME --broadcast

       Then re-run this script:

         BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS=7 DEST_CHAIN=AVALANCHE_FUJI AMOUNT=1000000000000000000 forge script script/operations/TransferTokens.s.sol --rpc-url $ETHEREUM_SEPOLIA_RPC_URL --account $KEYSTORE_NAME --broadcast
  Error: script failed: BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS too low. See logs above for corrective commands.

    ========================================
  ```

  <Aside type="note" title="Understand Minimum Block Depth Requirements 🧑‍🏫">
    The last command failed because the pool requires at least 20 block confirmations for custom finality, but we tried to process the
    transfer with only 7 block confirmations.

    Try and run the script again with an appropriate value for `BLOCK_CONFIRMATIONS` and see what happens.
  </Aside>

  You can check the status of the message on the [Chainlink CCIP Explorer](https://ccip.chain.link/) using the message ID provided in the output.
</Accordion>

<Aside type="caution" title="Educational Example Disclaimer">
  This page includes an educational example to use a Chainlink system, product, or service and is provided to
