# CCIP v2.0.0 ExtraArgsCodec API Reference
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/extra-args-codec

## Summary

`ExtraArgsCodec` is a gas-optimized Solidity library that encodes and decodes CCIP `extraArgs` payloads.

It defines:

- `GenericExtraArgsV3`
- SVM executor args (V1)
- Sui executor args (V1)

The library performs:

- Deterministic length-prefixed encoding
- Strict decode-time validation
- Tag-based version discrimination
- Precise error location reporting

The library contains no storage and performs no external calls.

***

## Library

`chains/evm/contracts/libraries/ExtraArgsCodec.sol`

***

## Import

```solidity
import {ExtraArgsCodec} from "chainlink-ccip/chains/evm/contracts/libraries/ExtraArgsCodec.sol";
```

***

## Types

### GenericExtraArgsV3

```solidity
struct GenericExtraArgsV3 {
  uint32 gasLimit;
  uint16 blockConfirmations;
  address[] ccvs;
  bytes[] ccvArgs;
  address executor;
  bytes executorArgs;
  bytes tokenReceiver;
  bytes tokenArgs;
}
```

***

### EncodingErrorLocation

```solidity
enum EncodingErrorLocation {
  DECODE_FIELD_LENGTH,
  DECODE_FIELD_CONTENT,
  EXTRA_ARGS_STATIC_LENGTH_FIELDS,
  EXTRA_ARGS_FINAL_OFFSET,
  SVM_EXECUTOR_ACCOUNTS_CONTENT,
  SVM_EXECUTOR_FINAL_OFFSET,
  SUI_EXECUTOR_OBJECT_IDS_CONTENT,
  SUI_EXECUTOR_FINAL_OFFSET,
  ENCODE_CCVS_ARRAY_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_CCV_ARGS_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_EXECUTOR_ARGS_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_TOKEN_RECEIVER_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_TOKEN_ARGS_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_SVM_ACCOUNTS_LENGTH,
  ENCODE_SUI_OBJECT_IDS_LENGTH
}
```

***

### SVMTokenReceiverUsage

```solidity
enum SVMTokenReceiverUsage {
  DERIVE_ATA_AND_CREATE,
  DERIVE_ATA_DONT_CREATE,
  USE_AS_IS
}
```

***

### SVMExecutorArgsV1

```solidity
struct SVMExecutorArgsV1 {
  SVMTokenReceiverUsage useATA;
  uint64 accountIsWritableBitmap;
  bytes32[] accounts;
}
```

***

### SuiExecutorArgsV1

```solidity
struct SuiExecutorArgsV1 {
  bytes32[] receiverObjectIds;
}
```

***

## Constants

```solidity
bytes4 public constant GENERIC_EXTRA_ARGS_V3_TAG = ...;
bytes4 public constant SVM_EXECUTOR_ARGS_V1_TAG = ...;
bytes4 public constant SUI_EXECUTOR_ARGS_V1_TAG = ...;
```

```solidity
uint256 public constant GENERIC_EXTRA_ARGS_V3_BASE_SIZE = ...;
uint256 public constant GENERIC_EXTRA_ARGS_V3_STATIC_LENGTH_SIZE = ...;
uint256 public constant SVM_EXECUTOR_ARGS_V1_BASE_SIZE = ...;
uint256 public constant SUI_EXECUTOR_ARGS_V1_BASE_SIZE = ...;
```

(All values match canonical source.)

***

## Errors

```solidity
error InvalidDataLength(
  EncodingErrorLocation location,
  uint256 offset
);

error InvalidExtraArgsTag(
  bytes4 expected,
  bytes4 actual
);

error InvalidAddressLength(uint256 length);

error CCVArrayLengthMismatch(
  uint256 ccvsLength,
  uint256 ccvArgsLength
);
```

***

## Functions

### _getBasicEncodedExtraArgsV3

```solidity
function _getBasicEncodedExtraArgsV3(
  uint32 gasLimit,
  uint16 blockConfirmations
) internal pure returns (bytes memory)
```

Returns minimal encoded `GenericExtraArgsV3` payload.

***

### _encodeGenericExtraArgsV3

```solidity
function _encodeGenericExtraArgsV3(
  GenericExtraArgsV3 memory extraArgs
) internal pure returns (bytes memory encoded)
