# CCIP v2.0.0 USDCSourcePoolDataCodec API Reference
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/usdc-source-pool-data-codec

## Summary

`USDCSourcePoolDataCodec` is a constants-only library defining version tags embedded in `sourcePoolData` for USDC transfers.

These tags are used by:

- `[USDCTokenPoolProxy](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/usdc-token-pool-proxy)`
- USDC CCTP v1 and v2 pool variants
- Hybrid lock-release flows

The first 4 bytes of `sourcePoolData` determine routing behavior.

This library contains no storage and no executable logic.

***

## Library

`chains/evm/contracts/libraries/USDCSourcePoolDataCodec.sol`

***

## Import

```solidity
import {USDCSourcePoolDataCodec} from "chainlink-ccip/chains/evm/contracts/libraries/USDCSourcePoolDataCodec.sol";
```

***

## Types

None declared.

***

## Constants

### LOCK_RELEASE_FLAG

```solidity
bytes4 public constant LOCK_RELEASE_FLAG =
  bytes4(keccak256("NO_CCTP_USE_LOCK_RELEASE"));
```

Indicates that lock-release semantics must be used instead of CCTP.

***

### CCTP_VERSION_2_TAG

```solidity
bytes4 public constant CCTP_VERSION_2_TAG =
  bytes4(keccak256("CCTP_V2"));
```

Indicates a standard CCTP v2 transfer (non-CCV path).

***

### CCTP_VERSION_2_CCV_TAG

```solidity
bytes4 public constant CCTP_VERSION_2_CCV_TAG =
  bytes4(keccak256("CCTP_V2_CCV"));
```

Indicates a CCTP v2 transfer using Cross-Chain Verifier (fast path).

***

## Functions

No functions are declared in this library.

***

## Usage context

Typical inbound routing logic:

```solidity
bytes4 version = bytes4(sourcePoolData[:4]);

if (version == LOCK_RELEASE_FLAG) { ... }
if (version == CCTP_VERSION_2_TAG) { ... }
if (version == CCTP_VERSION_2_CCV_TAG) { ... }
```

Legacy behavior:

- If `sourcePoolData.length == 64` and no tag is present, it may be interpreted as legacy CCTP v1 payload.

***

## Related Interfaces & Contracts

- [`USDCTokenPoolProxy`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/usdc-token-pool-proxy)
- [`LockReleaseTokenPool`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/lock-release-token-pool)
- [`BurnMintWithLockReleaseFlagTokenPool`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/burn-mint-with-lock-release-flag-token-pool)

