# CCIP v2.0.0 Pool API Reference
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/pool

## Summary

`Pool` is a minimal library that defines the canonical data structures and constants used by CCIP token pools.

It provides:

- Protocol-level constants for pool interface detection and return size limits
- Struct definitions for `lockOrBurn` and `releaseOrMint` flows

The library contains no storage and no executable logic.

***

## Library

`chains/evm/contracts/libraries/Pool.sol`

***

