# CCIP v2.0.0 IPoolV2 API Reference
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/i-pool-v2

## Summary

`IPoolV2` defines the extended V2 interface for CCIP token pools.

It supports:

- Enhanced `lockOrBurn` and `releaseOrMint` flows
- Cross-Chain Verifier (CCV) resolution
- [Pool](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/pool)-level fee configuration overrides
- Remote token resolution
- Block confirmation parameterization

***

## Contract

`chains/evm/contracts/interfaces/IPoolV2.sol`

***

## Import

```solidity
import {IPoolV2} from "chainlink-ccip/chains/evm/contracts/interfaces/IPoolV2.sol";
```

***

## Interface surface

```solidity
interface IPoolV2 is IERC165 {
```

***

### Enum: MessageDirection

```solidity
