  uint64 remoteChainSelector
)
  external
  view
  returns (bytes memory);
```

***

```solidity
}
```

***

## Integration notes / expectations

- Implementations must also support EIP-165.
- `lockOrBurn` and `releaseOrMint` must enforce ramp gating and validation internally.
- `getRequiredCCVs` may vary based on direction, amount, or confirmation mode.
- `getTokenTransferFeeConfig` returns override config; callers must respect `isEnabled`.
- `getRemoteToken` must return chain-family-compatible address encoding.

