# CCIP v2.0.0 CommitteeVerifier API Reference
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/committee-verifier

## Summary

`CommitteeVerifier` is a Cross-Chain Verifier (CCV) that validates messages using ordered ECDSA signature quorum.

It combines:

- Source-side forwarding (`forwardToVerifier`)
- Destination-side verification (`verifyMessage`)
- Signature quorum enforcement (`[SignatureQuorumValidator](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/signature-quorum-validator)`)
- Per-chain configuration and allowlist enforcement (`[BaseVerifier](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/base-verifier)`)
- RMN curse checks
- Dynamic config for fee aggregation and allowlist admin

***

## Contract

`chains/evm/contracts/ccvs/CommitteeVerifier.sol`

***

## Import

```solidity
import {CommitteeVerifier} from "chainlink-ccip/chains/evm/contracts/ccvs/CommitteeVerifier.sol";
```

***

## Inheritance

- `BaseVerifier`
- `SignatureQuorumValidator`
- `Ownable2StepMsgSender`
- `ICrossChainVerifierV1`
- `ITypeAndVersion`

***

## typeAndVersion

```solidity
string public constant override typeAndVersion =
  "CommitteeVerifier 2.0.0-dev";
```

***

## State

### Constants

```solidity
bytes4 internal constant VERSION_TAG_V1_7_0 = 0x49ff34ed;
uint256 internal constant VERIFIER_VERSION_BYTES = 4;
uint256 internal constant SIGNATURE_LENGTH_BYTES = 2;
```

***

### Immutables

None declared in this contract.

***

### Storage

```solidity
DynamicConfig private s_dynamicConfig;

address private s_storageLocationsAdmin;
address private s_pendingStorageLocationsAdmin;
```

Inherited storage:

- Remote chain configs (`BaseVerifier`)
- Signer configs (`SignatureQuorumValidator`)

