  address feeAggregator;
  address allowlistAdmin;
}
```

***

## Internal Functions

- `_setDynamicConfig`
- `_validateSignatures` (inherited)
- `_assertSenderIsAllowed` (inherited)
- `_assertNotCursedByRMN` (inherited)

***

## Security model

- Owner controls remote chain configuration and signature configuration.
- Allowlist admin may update allowlists but not other config.
- Signature quorum enforced with strict ordering.
- RMN curse check blocks verification.
- Fork replay protection via chainId binding.
- Storage locations admin can update metadata without being owner.

