- [`IRMNRemote`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/i-rmn-remote)
- [`MessageV1Codec`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/message-v1-codec)
- [`TokenPool`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/token-pool)

