***

## Internal Functions

### _setFeeAggregator

```solidity
function _setFeeAggregator(address feeAggregator) internal
```

Sets `s_feeAggregator` and emits `FeeAggregatorUpdated`.

***

## Security model

- Owner controls all implementation mappings.
- Inbound resolution is version-prefixed and deterministic.
- Outbound resolution keyed strictly by destination chain selector.
- Removal via `address(0)` sentinel.
- Withdrawal is permissionless but funds always routed to configured aggregator.
- Zero aggregator allowed but may cause withdrawal revert downstream.

***

## Related Interfaces & Contracts

- [`ICrossChainVerifierResolver`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/i-cross-chain-verifier-resolver)
- [`FeeTokenHandler`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/fee-token-handler)
- [`Ownable2StepMsgSender`](/ccip/evm/api-reference/v2.0.0/ownable-2-step-msg-sender)

