***

### getMinters

```solidity
function getMinters()
  external
  view
  returns (address[] memory)
```

***

### getBurners

```solidity
function getBurners()
  external
  view
  returns (address[] memory)
```

***

### getCCIPAdmin

```solidity
function getCCIPAdmin()
  external
  view
  returns (address)
```

***

### setCCIPAdmin

```solidity
