error SenderNotBurner(address sender);
error MaxSupplyExceeded(uint256 supplyAfterMint);
```

***

## Modifiers

```solidity
modifier onlyMinter();
modifier onlyBurner();
modifier validAddress(address recipient);
```

***

## Security model

- Owner controls mint and burn role assignments.
- Separate allowlists reduce blast radius.
- Optional hard max supply enforced on mint.
- `validAddress` prevents minting/transferring to token contract itself.
- `s_ccipAdmin` has no privileged execution rights; it is a registry pointer.

