event OwnershipTransferred(address from, address to);
```

***

## Errors

No errors declared in this contract.

Errors inherited from `Ownable2Step` may surface during ownership operations.

***

## Security model

- Ownership initialized to deployer.
- Two-step transfer prevents accidental ownership loss.
- New owner must explicitly accept ownership.
- No additional access control introduced beyond inherited behavior.

***

