# Move Module Interfaces Reference Documentation (Aptos)
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/v1/aptos/api-reference

## Available Versions

### Latest Release

- **[CCIP v1.6.0](/ccip/v1/aptos/api-reference/v1.6.0)** (Current Version)
  - Initial release for the Aptos blockchain
  - Cross-chain messaging from Aptos to EVM-based chains and EVM-based chains to Aptos
  - Token transfers using Aptos Fungible Assets
