## API References

### Core Components

- [CCIPReceiver](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/ccip-receiver) - Base contract for receiving CCIP messages
- [Client](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/client) - Library providing structs and types for building CCIP messages
- [FeeQuoter](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/fee-quoter) - Contract for managing gas and token prices in USD and calculating cross-chain fees
- [Internal](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/internal) - Library providing internal data structures and utilities for cross-chain message processing
- [IRouterClient](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/i-router-client) - Interface for sending messages through CCIP
- [Pool](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/pool) - Library providing token pool functions for cross-chain operations
- [RateLimiter](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/rate-limiter) - Contract for managing rate limits on token transfers
- [TypeAndVersion](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/i-type-and-version) - Interface for contract versioning

### Token Pools

- [BurnFromMintTokenPool](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/burn-from-mint-token-pool) - Implementation using `burnFrom(address, amount)` for token burning
- [BurnMintERC20](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/burn-mint-erc20) - Implementation for burning and minting ERC20 tokens
- [BurnMintTokenPool](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/burn-mint-token-pool) - Implementation using `burn(amount)` for token burning
- [BurnMintTokenPoolAbstract](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/burn-mint-token-pool-abstract) - Abstract contract for burn/mint token handling
- [LockReleaseTokenPool](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/lock-release-token-pool) - Implementation for locking and releasing tokens on their native chain
- [TokenPool](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/token-pool) - Base abstract class defining common functionality for all token pools

### Access Control

- [Ownable2Step](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/ownable-2-step) - Base contract implementing secure two-step ownership transfer
- [Ownable2StepMsgSender](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/ownable-2-step-msg-sender) - Extension of Ownable2Step that sets msg.sender as initial owner

### Registry Components

- [RegistryModuleOwnerCustom](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/registry-module-owner-custom) - Registry module for token admin registration
- [TokenAdminRegistry](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/token-admin-registry) - Contract for storing token pool configurations

### Events and Error Handling

- [Events](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/events) - Events emitted during CCIP operations including `ccipSend` and `ccipReceive`
- [Errors](/ccip/v1/evm/api-reference/v1.5.1/errors) - Comprehensive list of CCIP error codes and their descriptions

