      ```
    </Fragment>

    <Fragment slot="panel.2">
      If you use [Yarn](https://yarnpkg.com/), install the [@chainlink/contracts-ccip NPM package](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@chainlink/contracts-ccip):

      ```shell
