```

<Aside>Thrown when attempting to add a pool that is already configured for a chain.</Aside>

**Parameters**

| Name                  | Type     | Description                              |
| --------------------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `remoteChainSelector` | `uint64` | The chain selector where the pool exists |
