```

**Parameters**

| Name                  | Type     | Indexed | Description                              |
| --------------------- | -------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| `remoteChainSelector` | `uint64` | Yes     | The identifier of the chain for the pool |
| `remotePoolAddress`   | `bytes`  | No      | The address of the removed pool          |

