   2025-10-21T16:42:39.838Z info: 🔹 Using signer: 0x8c244f0b2164e6a3bed74ab429b0ebd661bb14ca
   2025-10-21T16:42:39.838Z info: Using TokenAdminRegistry: 0x95F29FEE11c5C55d26cCcf1DB6772DE953B37B82
