   ```

2. **Set the pool for Ethereum Sepolia:**

   ```bash
   npx hardhat setPool \
     --tokenaddress 0xb613B55897F07eAF430bF9a509498e55487305Ea --pooladdress 0x5e8b0e5EAC57d73E7b93d85b8eA3fcaDa282868A \
     --network ethereumSepolia
   ```

