# Getting Started with CCIP
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/v1/getting-started/overview

This section helps you choose the **best way to start building with CCIP**, based on your experience level and goals.

## Choose how you want to start

### Quickstart: Send Your First Cross-Chain Transfer

A minimal, step-by-step introduction to sending a cross-chain message.

[Start the Quickstart →](quickstart)

### Build with CCIP Starter Kits

Start from maintained, production-oriented code using Hardhat or Foundry.

[Use the Starter Kits →](build-with-starter-kits)

### Acquire Test Tokens

Get test tokens and verify supported networks and lanes before building.

[Acquire test tokens →](acquire-test-tokens)

If you’re not sure which path to choose, start with the Quickstart.

