# CCIP Service Limits
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/v1/service-limits
Last Updated: 2025-09-03

This section outlines the operational limits for Chainlink CCIP across different blockchain architectures.

- **[EVM Service Limits](/ccip/v1/evm/service-limits)**: Service limits for Ethereum and other EVM-compatible blockchains.
- **[Solana Service Limits](/ccip/v1/svm/service-limits)**: Service limits for Solana.
- **[Aptos Service Limits](/ccip/v1/aptos/service-limits)**: Service limits for Aptos.
- **[Network-Specific Limits](/ccip/v1/service-limits/network-specific-limits)**: Documented network-specific limitations (all blockchain families).

Understanding these limits is essential for building reliable cross-chain applications that operate within CCIP's intended parameters.

