# CCIP Tutorials
Source: https://docs.chain.link/ccip/v1/tutorials/overview

Tutorials show **how to build with CCIP** using step-by-step examples and real code.

They focus on implementation details, workflows, and APIs, and assume familiarity with CCIP fundamentals.

## Choose what you want to build

### Create a Cross-Chain Token (CCT)

For asset issuers enabling tokens across multiple chains.

Available on:

- [EVM](/ccip/v1/evm/tutorials/cross-chain-tokens)
- [SVM (Solana)](/ccip/v1/svm/tutorials/cross-chain-tokens)
- [Aptos](/ccip/v1/aptos/tutorials/cross-chain-tokens)

### Send Tokens and Data Cross-Chain

For application developers building programmable token transfer workflows.

Available on:

- [EVM](/ccip/v1/evm/tutorials/programmable-token-transfers)
- [SVM (Solana)](/ccip/v1/svm/tutorials/programmable-token-transfers)
- [Aptos](/ccip/v1/aptos/tutorials/programmable-token-transfers)

### Send Arbitrary Messages

For application-level cross-chain messaging.

Available on:

- [EVM](/ccip/v1/evm/tutorials/send-arbitrary-data)
- [SVM (Solana)](/ccip/v1/svm/tutorials/send-arbitrary-data)
- [Aptos](/ccip/v1/aptos/tutorials/send-arbitrary-data)
